                        "entry_id": "600922ee-1a22-3e76-96bb-9fd43307fbf9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ararat (a mountain in the Armenian Highlands, in modern-day Turkey)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "48022540-6a4d-4d5d-883a-cdab4acfcc17",
                                "sense_id": "71fece2f-0805-3fb6-bc42-f89f2156519d",
                                "text": "И приста́л ковче́г к горе Арара́т, и стал Ной выпуска́ть живо́тных, и уви́дел он люде́й к нему́ бегу́щих и рука́ми ма́шущих. И крича́ли они́: \"Гляди́-ка! Цирк прие́хал!!!\"",
                                "translation": "And the ark landed on Mount Ararat, and Noah began to release the animals, and he saw people running towards him waving their arms. And they cried: \"Look! The circus is here!\"",
                                "english": "And the ark landed on Mount Ararat, and Noah began to release the animals, and he saw people running towards him waving their arms. And they cried: \"Look! The circus is here!\""
                            }
