                                                "sense_id": "220a500c-95f1-3234-b194-28ebb781be43",
                                                "text": "We left Poland in a heavy snow and enjoyed the flight to Tehran, flying over some very interesting terrain. Although it was a clear day, we never were sure whether or not we saw Mount Ararat to the north."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
